* [[Clackmannanshire Central]], [[Clackmannanshire East]], [[Clackmannanshire North]], [[Clackmannanshire South]], and [[Clackmannanshire West]] from the [[Ochil and South Perthshire (UK Parliament constituency)|Ochil and South Perthshire constituency]]

