Further to the [[2023 Periodic Review of Westminster constituencies]], which came into effect for the 2024 general election, the composition of the constituency is as follows (as they existed on 1 December 2020):<ref>{{Cite web |title=New Seat Details - Arbroath and Broughty Ferry |url=https://www.electoralcalculus.co.uk/fcgi-bin/calcwork23.py?seat=Arbroath%20and%20Broughty%20Ferry |access-date=2023-07-29 |website=www.electoralcalculus.co.uk}}</ref>

