{{Short description|Parliamentary constituency in the United Kingdom, 2024 onwards}}
{{Infobox UK constituency main|name=Stirling and Strathallan|parliament=uk|image=[[File:StirlingStrathallan2024Constituency.svg|258px]]|caption=Boundary of Stirling and Strathallan in [[Scotland]]|map_entity=Scotland|map_year=2024|year=[[2024 United Kingdom general election|2024]]|abolished=|type=County|previous=[[Stirling (UK Parliament constituency)|Stirling]] & [[Ochil and South Perthshire (UK Parliament constituency)|Ochil and South Perthshire]]|next=|electorate=|mp=[[Chris Kane (politician)|Chris Kane]]|party=[[Scottish Labour|Labour]]|region=Scotland|county=[[Stirlingshire]] and [[Perth and Kinross]]|european=|elects_howmany=One|towns=[[Stirling]], [[Dunblane]], [[Bannockburn]], [[Bridge of Allan]]}}'''Stirling and Strathallan''' is a [[List of UK Parliament constituencies|constituency]] of the [[House of Commons of the United Kingdom|House of Commons]] in the [[Parliament of the United Kingdom|UK Parliament]].<ref>{{Cite web |title=28 June 2023 - 2023 Review Report laid before Parliament {{!}} The Boundary Commission for Scotland |url=https://www.bcomm-scotland.independent.gov.uk/?q=resources/news/28-june-2023-2023-review-report-laid-parliament |access-date=2023-06-29 |website=www.bcomm-scotland.independent.gov.uk}}</ref> Further to the completion of the [[2023 Periodic Review of Westminster constituencies]], it will first be contested at the [[2024 United Kingdom general election|2024 general election]].

The constituency name refers to the city of [[Stirling]] and the valley of [[Strathallan]].

== Contents ==
{{maplink|raw={{Wikipedia:Map data/Stirling and Strathallan (UK Parliament constituency)}}|frame=yes|frame-height=260|text=Map of boundaries from 2024}}
The constituency will comprise the following wards of the [[Stirling (council area)|Stirling council area]]:<ref>{{Cite web |title=New Seat Details - Stirling and Strathallan |url=https://www.electoralcalculus.co.uk/fcgi-bin/calcwork23.py?seat=Stirling%20and%20Strathallan |access-date=2023-07-29 |website=www.electoralcalculus.co.uk}}</ref>

From the [[Stirling (UK Parliament constituency)|Stirling constituency]]:

* [[Bannockburn (ward)|Bannockburn]]
* [[Trossachs and Teith (ward)|Trossachs and Teith]]
* [[Forth and Endrick (ward)|Forth and Endrick]]
* [[Dunblane and Bridge of Allan (ward)|Dunblane and Bridge of Allan]]
* [[Stirling North (ward)|Stirling North]]
* [[Stirling West (ward)|Stirling West]]
* [[Stirling East (ward)|Stirling East]]

And in [[Perth and Kinross]]:

* Part of [[Strathallan (ward)|Strathallan]] from the [[Ochil and South Perthshire (UK Parliament constituency)|Ochil and South Perthshire constituency]]

